{
  "id": "6aa5ed7fd251b56bcdced193",
  "title": "複数の意味にとれる文",
  "created": 1789259138,
  "updated": 1789259658,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aa5ed7fd251b56bcdced193",
      "text": "複数の意味にとれる文",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259138,
      "updated": 1789259138
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ed8200000000000509e0",
      "text": " あっちの意味にも、こっちの意味にもとれて、[一意に定まらない]文",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259138,
      "updated": 1789259219
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ef1300000000000509f2",
      "text": " どちらかの意味に確定させるような情報を渡すと[一意に定まる]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259539,
      "updated": 1789259609
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ed8800000000000509e3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259144,
      "updated": 1789259145
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ed8900000000000509e4",
      "text": "例",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259145,
      "updated": 1789259164
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ed9c00000000000509e5",
      "text": " 「[半殺しがいいか、本殺しがいいか]……」",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259164,
      "updated": 1789259309
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ede600000000000509e6",
      "text": "  民家に泊まっている旅人が、夜中に家主が包丁を研ぎながらこれを言っているのを聞いたとき",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259239,
      "updated": 1789259273
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ee4e00000000000509eb",
      "text": "  aとbのどちらにも読み取れる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259342,
      "updated": 1789259408
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ee0900000000000509e7",
      "text": "   a 家主が自分(旅人)を半殺し/本殺しにしようとしている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259273,
      "updated": 1789259409
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ee0b00000000000509e8",
      "text": "   b 家主が[あんこ]を作ろうとしている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259275,
      "updated": 1789259410
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ee6500000000000509f1",
      "text": " [アンジャッシュ状態]の会話がそうかも",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259365,
      "updated": 1789259658
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ee6000000000000509ed",
      "text": " [募集.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259360,
      "updated": 1789259363
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5ee6400000000000509f0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789259364,
      "updated": 1789259364
    }
  ]
}